# Ignore everything under chr17_variants (large datasets: chr17_samples,
# reef, reef_regex, variants, docs, ...) EXCEPT the scripts/ source tree.
# Using chr17_variants/* (not chr17_variants) leaves the directory itself
# un-excluded so the scripts/ re-include below can take effect; the sibling
# data folders stay ignored, so `git reset --hard` never touches them.
chr17_variants/*
!chr17_variants/scripts/
chr17_variants/scripts/__pycache__/
